rows.en:
"I'm getting out of here, even if I have to go by myself.
Please ask someone else on a date."
I shook off Kazama's arms and stood on the floor of the landing on my own two feet.{p}

But...
Watching him, I started itching to move too.
I think I'll try dancing along with him.{p}

"{b}, take a look at everyone's feet."
Laughing gleefully, Kazama spoke to me.
Everyone's feet...?{p}

There, on my feet, were red shoes all my own...{p}Ahh............
So I have to keep dancing too.
The devil's dance, going on and on with no end in sight............{p}

But to fall down the stairs without a single scratch...
It must be because I'm always such a good girl.
Now, I need to get out of here, fast.{p}

From far off, I could hear police sirens.
Hosoda must have called them.
Seeing this, how many people would ever believe what I say...?{p}Sinking unsteadily down into the pool of bright red blood, I pictured the red siren lights I would surely be seeing any moment now.{p}
